sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Sensors (IoT)
    participant M as MQTT Broker
    participant T as Digital Twin (Core)
    participant A as AI Model (Intelligence)
    participant D as Dashboard

    S->>M: Raw Telemetry (Voltage, Current)
    M->>T: Cleaned Data Stream
    T->>A: Feature Inputs
    A->>T: Predictions / Anomaly Status
    T->>D: Real-time JSON State
    D->>D: Render 3D Maps & Plots